{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In Lorsvale, four factions compete for dominance. As a new arrival you can build alliances and make enemies of a variety of factions. Find strong allies and equipment for your warband, build your numbers and alliances, and set out to conquer dungeons and engage in open world skirmishes with other roving bands of foes. With a team of capable fighters at your side you can shape the future of the Lorsvale, through real-time action combat, questing for reputation or riches, and finding unique and disparate companions, there's many ways this story can end, and they will all be down to your choices.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1974190?t=1763206816","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974190/454a1bdaa705a2abf1ee389877faed8635b8a12c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763206816","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974190/446f257e2fa895fdc90285389e828875a68dbb39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763206816","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1974190/446f257e2fa895fdc90285389e828875a68dbb39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763206816","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In Lorsvale, four factions compete for dominance. As a new arrival you can build alliances and make enemies of a variety of factions. Find strong allies and equipment for your warband, build your numbers and alliances, and set out to conquer dungeons and engage in open world skirmishes with other roving bands of foes. With a team of capable fighters at your side you can shape the future of the Lorsvale, through real-time action combat, questing for reputation or riches, and finding unique and disparate